  "title": "N5文法49【感嘆詞】「ああ、ええ、そう、あの、さあ、いいえ、はい」",
  "point": "ああ、ええ、そう、あの、さあ、いいえ、はい",
  "gloss": "",
  "url": "https://www.sigure.tw/learn-japanese/grammar/n5/49",
  "source": "https://www.sigure.tw",
  "published": "2016-09-07",
